<section class="section" aria-labelledby="does-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="case-title" id="does-title">What it does for your business</h2>
    <div class="grid-2 case-features">
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Fast, paperless check-in</h3><ul><li>Register the customer and their motorcycle in seconds.</li><li>The work order opens right from the front desk.</li><li>Each motorcycle keeps its full service history.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Work orders everyone can see</h3><ul><li>Status board: diagnosis, awaiting approval, in repair or ready.</li><li>Every order has a responsible technician.</li><li>The whole team knows what’s next without asking.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Customers approve from their phone</h3><ul><li>They get a secure WhatsApp link with the quote.</li><li>Approve or reject: no more “I never authorized that”.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Parts and inventory up to date</h3><ul><li>Stock per location with every entry and exit recorded.</li><li>Parts are deducted automatically when used on an order.</li><li>Service catalog with its own prices per location.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Hassle-free invoicing and payments</h3><ul><li>Invoice or receipt with VAT calculated, controlled deposits and discounts.</li><li>PDF via secure link or WhatsApp, in pesos with no rounding errors.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Multiple locations, roles and reports</h3><ul><li>Each location runs its own operation; management sees the full picture.</li><li>Roles for front desk, technicians, cashier, administration and management.</li><li>Sales, operations, technician and customer reports.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>“My bike”: customers check their history</h3><ul><li>With the plate and their ID they see the history online.</li><li>It shows a yellow plate just like their bike’s: it builds trust.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Traceability and security</h3><ul><li>Voids, discounts, price changes and stock exits are all logged.</li><li>Nothing is deleted: documents are voided and the trail remains.</li><li>Computer, tablet or phone, with light and dark mode.</li></ul></article>
    </div>
  </div>
